 ```

+To start an app while keeping desktop input disabled, combine
+`--start-app` with `--no-control`. App startup is a one-time request; scrcpy
+will not forward keyboard, mouse, or touch input:
+
+```bash
+scrcpy --new-display --start-app=com.termux --no-control
+```
+
